{
  "slug": "review-ready",
  "name": "Review Ready",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Pre-submission auditor for iOS App Store and Google Play. Scans your app against every guideline before you submit.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**, **5 agents** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `fix` (Auto-fixes safe pre-submission compliance issues identified by /review-ready:scan), `precheck` (Quick pre-submission sanity check for iOS and Android apps), `scan` (Pre-submission compliance audit for iOS App Store and Google Play)\n- **Agents** (5): `crash-risk-auditor` (Audits a mobile app for stability and quality issues that cause Apple 2.1 (App Completeness) and Google minimum-functionality…), `iap-business-auditor` (Audits a mobile app for monetization compliance against Apple App Store Review Guideline 3.1 (In-App Purchase) and Google…), `metadata-auditor` (Audits a mobile app's metadata and configuration for store compliance), `permissions-auditor` (Audits a mobile app for permissions and sensitive API compliance), `privacy-auditor` (Audits a mobile app project for privacy compliance against Apple App Store Review Guideline 5.1 (Privacy) and Google…)\n- **Hooks** (1): `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install review-ready@claude-community` from `manthanmk66/review-ready`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 3,
    "agent": 5,
    "hook": 1
  },
